      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "**Commit Stage:**\n- Ensure code quality with local testing. \n- Deploy changes to the staging environment only if tests pass.\n- Requirement: Rigorous code review before commit; automated unit tests must pass.\n\n**Automated Testing Stage:**\n- Automated integration, functional, and load tests run.\n- Achieve code base stability by catching bugs early.\n- Requirement: High code coverage; tests must pass; feature toggles for incremental rollouts.\n\n**Staging Environment:**\n- Mirror production setup closely.\n- Perform manual and automated end-to-end testing.\n- Requirement: Green light from both QA and product managers; team need for additional checks and debugging.\n\n**Production Deployment Stage:**\n- Gradual roll-out (e.g., feature toggles or blue-green deployments).\n- Monitor performance and functionality; maintain rollback capabilities.\n- Requirement: Approval by senior team or management; compliance with uptime SLAs.",
